ion symlink redirection, supports concurrent complete exports, preserves prior output on failure, cleans staging artifacts, and preserves the source, sentinel, OS, and kernel. The provider-wide node-restart evidence protocol is complete and independently consistent with the lifecycle boot observations.","limitations":[]}
